      <title>安装新开发工具前，七项安全检查不可少</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260820/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E6%96%B0%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%83%E9%A1%B9%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%B0%91/</link>
